      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00004",
      "start_ms": 2950,
      "end_ms": 5250,
      "text": "海南环岛把冬天甩在身后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5890,
      "end_ms": 10090,
      "text": "皖南环线在徽州长卷里翻甘南环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10110,
      "end_ms": 13990,
      "text": "把西藏搬到了甘肃滇西北环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14170,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "把云南四季过一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16610,
      "end_ms": 19670,
      "text": "青海大环线把历史和风景串成圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20210,
      "end_ms": 22770,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 26850,
      "text": "有人说川藏线呢北疆环线呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27030,
      "end_ms": 28530,
      "text": "呼伦贝尔环线了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 30420,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30960,
      "end_ms": 33520,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34060,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "一条比一条震撼川藏线排第四。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38480,
      "end_ms": 40760,
      "text": "最后那个从成都出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41060,
      "end_ms": 41720,
      "text": "走一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42100,
      "end_ms": 51180,
      "text": "回到成都雪山草原藏寨全都有老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51540,
      "end_ms": 52980,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00019",
      "start_ms": 52980,
      "end_ms": 54400,
      "text": "在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54700,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "内蒙古呼伦贝尔环线从海拉尔出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00021",
      "start_ms": 58780,
      "end_ms": 62505,
      "text": "经额尔古纳、石尾摸耳道嘎、满洲里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00022",
      "start_ms": 62750,
      "end_ms": 63665,
      "text": "再回海拉尔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64090,
      "end_ms": 65635,
      "text": "全程一千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66070,
      "end_ms": 68000,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68000,
      "end_ms": 71420,
      "text": "他把中国最好的草原串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00026",
      "start_ms": 72200,
      "end_ms": 73580,
      "text": "呼伦贝尔大草原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73940,
      "end_ms": 78915,
      "text": "世界四大草原之一、德尔古纳湿地、亚洲第一湿地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79260,
      "end_ms": 81335,
      "text": "实为俄罗斯民族乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00029",
      "start_ms": 81650,
      "end_ms": 82605,
      "text": "穆克楞房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82860,
      "end_ms": 85905,
      "text": "摩尔道嘎大兴安岭原始森林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86790,
      "end_ms": 87565,
      "text": "满洲里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87840,
      "end_ms": 89675,
      "text": "中俄蒙三国风情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90410,
      "end_ms": 91445,
      "text": "套娃广场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00034",
      "start_ms": 91780,
      "end_ms": 92285,
      "text": "国门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92620,
      "end_ms": 95665,
      "text": "一路草原森林湿地边境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95950,
      "end_ms": 98800,
      "text": "您夏天去草原绿到天边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00037",
      "start_ms": 99020,
      "end_ms": 99615,
      "text": "二十度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00038",
      "start_ms": 99890,
      "end_ms": 101125,
      "text": "晚上盖被子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101620,
      "end_ms": 102815,
      "text": "您说这是自驾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00040",
      "start_ms": 103140,
      "end_ms": 105615,
      "text": "还是在一副草原长卷里走了一圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106140,
      "end_ms": 110930,
      "text": "第四名川藏线从成都出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00042",
      "start_ms": 111150,
      "end_ms": 120065,
      "text": "经雅安、康定、新都桥、李唐、八、唐盲、康、左贡、八宿、波蜜、灵芝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120510,
      "end_ms": 121350,
      "text": "一直到拉萨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00044",
      "start_ms": 121610,
      "end_ms": 123675,
      "text": "全长两千一百四十二公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00045",
      "start_ms": 124510,
      "end_ms": 126240,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126240,
      "end_ms": 127600,
      "text": "他从海拔五百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00047",
      "start_ms": 127600,
      "end_ms": 129025,
      "text": "一路爬到五千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00048",
      "start_ms": 129540,
      "end_ms": 130825,
      "text": "翻十几座大山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00049",
      "start_ms": 131180,
      "end_ms": 136040,
      "text": "跨十几条大河折多山崖口经翻在风里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00050",
      "start_ms": 136040,
      "end_ms": 140605,
      "text": "略略响远处的贡嘎雪山群峰若隐若现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141480,
      "end_ms": 145365,
      "text": "新都桥光与影的天堂日落的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00052",
      "start_ms": 145700,
      "end_ms": 148405,
      "text": "塔宫草原方向美的不像真的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00053",
      "start_ms": 148870,
      "end_ms": 149645,
      "text": "杨芜湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00054",
      "start_ms": 150180,
      "end_ms": 152545,
      "text": "碧绿的湖面倒映着雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153330,
      "end_ms": 155610,
      "text": "清晨雾气缭绕的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00056",
      "start_ms": 155770,
      "end_ms": 159350,
      "text": "您站在湖边分不清哪是天哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00057",
      "start_ms": 159350,
      "end_ms": 162910,
      "text": "是水木将七十二拐一条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00058",
      "start_ms": 162910,
      "end_ms": 164545,
      "text": "在悬崖边拐了又拐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00059",
      "start_ms": 164920,
      "end_ms": 167600,
      "text": "从山顶一直盘到谷底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00060",
      "start_ms": 167840,
      "end_ms": 171585,
      "text": "林芝西藏的江南春天桃花开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00061",
      "start_ms": 172030,
      "end_ms": 175640,
      "text": "雪山底下全是粉色的中国国家地理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175640,
      "end_ms": 177685,
      "text": "管他叫中国人的景观大道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00063",
      "start_ms": 178130,
      "end_ms": 178970,
      "text": "一天之内，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00064",
      "start_ms": 179250,
      "end_ms": 184660,
      "text": "雪山、湖泊、藏寨、草原寺庙全在你眼前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00065",
      "start_ms": 184700,
      "end_ms": 186615,
      "text": "过走一趟川藏线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00066",
      "start_ms": 187410,
      "end_ms": 191215,
      "text": "等于看了大半个中国别的路线是串起风景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00067",
      "start_ms": 191770,
      "end_ms": 196145,
      "text": "川藏线是把半个中国的风景铺在了一条路上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00068",
      "start_ms": 196540,
      "end_ms": 200935,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00069",
      "start_ms": 201480,
      "end_ms": 204640,
      "text": "左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00070",
      "start_ms": 204640,
      "end_ms": 207275,
      "text": "加一段五十来个字的冷知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00071",
      "start_ms": 207870,
      "end_ms": 209545,
      "text": "右边是日期记事夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00072",
      "start_ms": 210020,
      "end_ms": 211920,
      "text": "什么季节去哪座小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00073",
      "start_ms": 212260,
      "end_ms": 213160,
      "text": "走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00074",
      "start_ms": 213260,
      "end_ms": 214875,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00075",
      "start_ms": 215270,
      "end_ms": 216455,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00076",
      "start_ms": 216970,
      "end_ms": 219555,
      "text": "不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00077",
      "start_ms": 220080,
      "end_ms": 221475,
      "text": "是帮你挑日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00078",
      "start_ms": 222510,
      "end_ms": 223985,
      "text": "今天翻到呼伦贝尔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00079",
      "start_ms": 224420,
      "end_ms": 226105,
      "text": "明天翻到川藏线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00080",
      "start_ms": 226490,
      "end_ms": 228065,
      "text": "后天翻到川西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00081",
      "start_ms": 228620,
      "end_ms": 229460,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00082",
      "start_ms": 229620,
      "end_ms": 235035,
      "text": "就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00083",
      "start_ms": 235810,
      "end_ms": 238795,
      "text": "翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00084",
      "start_ms": 239180,
      "end_ms": 240955,
      "text": "就去网上搜搜照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00085",
      "start_ms": 241840,
      "end_ms": 243365,
      "text": "搜完就想订票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00086",
      "start_ms": 244320,
      "end_ms": 246570,
      "text": "我已经放下面点开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00087",
      "start_ms": 246770,
      "end_ms": 249825,
      "text": "就能看到喜欢到处走走的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00088",
      "start_ms": 250110,
      "end_ms": 251350,
      "text": "弄一本放茶几。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00089",
      "start_ms": 251350,
      "end_ms": 252930,
      "text": "上一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00090",
      "start_ms": 253150,
      "end_ms": 255290,
      "text": "整个中国哪儿值得去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00091",
      "start_ms": 255310,
      "end_ms": 258035,
      "text": "哪个乐曲心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00092",
      "start_ms": 259680,
      "end_ms": 260315,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00093",
      "start_ms": 260930,
      "end_ms": 263425,
      "text": "贵州环县从贵阳出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00094",
      "start_ms": 263750,
      "end_ms": 269675,
      "text": "经黄果树沥波、西江千户苗寨、镇远、梵净山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00095",
      "start_ms": 270050,
      "end_ms": 270945,
      "text": "再回贵阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00096",
      "start_ms": 271180,
      "end_ms": 272695,
      "text": "全程一千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00097",
      "start_ms": 273410,
      "end_ms": 280215,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他把贵州的山水和民族风情串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00098",
      "start_ms": 280870,
      "end_ms": 282025,
      "text": "黄果树瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00099",
      "start_ms": 282420,
      "end_ms": 285475,
      "text": "亚洲第一大瀑布利波小七孔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00100",
      "start_ms": 286150,
      "end_ms": 290255,
      "text": "地球腰带上的绿宝石西江千户苗寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00101",
      "start_ms": 290720,
      "end_ms": 304725,
      "text": "世界最大的苗族聚居村寨镇原古城太极图上的千年古城梵净山、蘑菇石、红云金顶一路瀑布。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00102",
      "start_ms": 305130,
      "end_ms": 307810,
      "text": "溶洞苗寨、洞寨古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00103",
      "start_ms": 308190,
      "end_ms": 310510,
      "text": "宁夏天去避暑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00104",
      "start_ms": 310690,
      "end_ms": 314750,
      "text": "冬天去看苗年一条环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00105",
      "start_ms": 314970,
      "end_ms": 319770,
      "text": "把贵州最野的山水和最浓的民族味儿全串在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00106",
      "start_ms": 320250,
      "end_ms": 320850,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00107",
      "start_ms": 321230,
      "end_ms": 323490,
      "text": "滇藏县从昆明出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00108",
      "start_ms": 323790,
      "end_ms": 335320,
      "text": "经大理、丽江、香格里拉、德钦、延井、芒康、左贡巴秀、波密、林芝一直到了拉萨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00109",
      "start_ms": 335820,
      "end_ms": 338120,
      "text": "全长两千三百多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00110",
      "start_ms": 338940,
      "end_ms": 339540,
      "text": "这条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00111",
      "start_ms": 339540,
      "end_ms": 343860,
      "text": "最绝的是他从热带雨林一路爬到雪山高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00112",
      "start_ms": 344400,
      "end_ms": 346980,
      "text": "从海拔五百米爬到五千多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00113",
      "start_ms": 347780,
      "end_ms": 356720,
      "text": "严理的苍山洱海、丽江的玉龙雪山、香格里拉的普达措、梅里雪山的日照金山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00114",
      "start_ms": 357280,
      "end_ms": 359120,
      "text": "盐井的千年盐田。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00115",
      "start_ms": 359580,
      "end_ms": 365465,
      "text": "然芜湖怒江七十二拐林芝的桃花一条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00116",
      "start_ms": 365900,
      "end_ms": 367685,
      "text": "从云南走到西藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00117",
      "start_ms": 367960,
      "end_ms": 369915,
      "text": "从热带走到高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00118",
      "start_ms": 370380,
      "end_ms": 371685,
      "text": "走一趟滇藏县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00119",
      "start_ms": 372110,
      "end_ms": 375415,
      "text": "等于把云南和西藏的精华全看了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00120",
      "start_ms": 375970,
      "end_ms": 379845,
      "text": "中国国家地理管它叫进藏最美路线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00121",
      "start_ms": 380800,
      "end_ms": 381405,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00122",
      "start_ms": 381780,
      "end_ms": 385475,
      "text": "川西大环线从成都出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00123",
      "start_ms": 385980,
      "end_ms": 395190,
      "text": "经都江堰、四姑娘山、丹巴、瑟达、甘孜、李唐、稻成、亚丁、新都桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00124",
      "start_ms": 395490,
      "end_ms": 398665,
      "text": "康定再回成都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00125",
      "start_ms": 398960,
      "end_ms": 400255,
      "text": "全程两千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00126",
      "start_ms": 400620,
      "end_ms": 402320,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00127",
      "start_ms": 402320,
      "end_ms": 406235,
      "text": "他把川西最好的风景全串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00128",
      "start_ms": 406750,
      "end_ms": 420795,
      "text": "四姑娘山单巴藏寨、色达五名佛学院、干孜草原、李唐世界高城道城、亚丁水蓝色星球上的最后一片净土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00129",
      "start_ms": 421320,
      "end_ms": 422120,
      "text": "新都桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00130",
      "start_ms": 422380,
      "end_ms": 423785,
      "text": "光与影的天堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00131",
      "start_ms": 424150,
      "end_ms": 424785,
      "text": "牛背山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00132",
      "start_ms": 425700,
      "end_ms": 427700,
      "text": "中国最大的观景平台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00133",
      "start_ms": 427980,
      "end_ms": 437660,
      "text": "一条环线从海拔五百米爬到四千七百米雪山、草原、葬寨、寺庙、冰川、湖泊全都有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00134",
      "start_ms": 437780,
      "end_ms": 438655,
      "text": "您走一趟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00135",
      "start_ms": 439210,
      "end_ms": 442985,
      "text": "等于把川崎高原从头到尾看了一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00136",
      "start_ms": 443910,
      "end_ms": 445485,
      "text": "别的路线串一条线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00137",
      "start_ms": 446370,
      "end_ms": 449005,
      "text": "川西大环线串的是一个高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00138",
      "start_ms": 449860,
      "end_ms": 452695,
      "text": "这才是真正做头把交椅的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00139",
      "start_ms": 453360,
      "end_ms": 455440,
      "text": "不是哪一条路有多美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00140",
      "start_ms": 455740,
      "end_ms": 460135,
      "text": "是这一圈把整个川西的美全装进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00141",
      "start_ms": 460640,
      "end_ms": 461955,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00142",
      "start_ms": 462790,
      "end_ms": 464305,
      "text": "这十条自驾路线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00143",
      "start_ms": 464570,
      "end_ms": 469250,
      "text": "没有一条是光靠好看出名的海南环岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00144",
      "start_ms": 469270,
      "end_ms": 471345,
      "text": "靠的是把冬天甩在身后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00145",
      "start_ms": 472130,
      "end_ms": 474875,
      "text": "皖南环线靠的是徽州长卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00146",
      "start_ms": 475410,
      "end_ms": 478950,
      "text": "甘南环线靠的是把西藏搬到甘肃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00147",
      "start_ms": 479150,
      "end_ms": 482370,
      "text": "滇西北环线靠的是云南四季青，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00148",
      "start_ms": 482410,
      "end_ms": 483290,
      "text": "海大环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00149",
      "start_ms": 483370,
      "end_ms": 486195,
      "text": "靠的是历史和风景串成圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00150",
      "start_ms": 486770,
      "end_ms": 489045,
      "text": "呼伦贝尔靠的是草原长卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00151",
      "start_ms": 489560,
      "end_ms": 493285,
      "text": "川藏线靠的是把半个中国不在路上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00152",
      "start_ms": 493840,
      "end_ms": 496725,
      "text": "贵州环线靠的是山水和民族味儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00153",
      "start_ms": 497200,
      "end_ms": 502150,
      "text": "滇藏线靠的是从热带走到高原川西大环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00154",
      "start_ms": 502290,
      "end_ms": 504685,
      "text": "靠的是把一个高原装进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00155",
      "start_ms": 505130,
      "end_ms": 509410,
      "text": "每一条路线的厉害之处都不在他有多长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00156",
      "start_ms": 509770,
      "end_ms": 511225,
      "text": "在他串起了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00157",
      "start_ms": 512050,
      "end_ms": 512895,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ddb5a8ad7ccdb86_s00158",
      "start_ms": 513280,
      "end_ms": 514895,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
